    "sub_ename": "CRITICAL THINKING AND EXPRESSION IN CHINESE(1) RECITATION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程搭配中文思辨與表達(一)每週的教學進度，進行實作和演練，提升國際生華語聽說讀寫基本能力，培養國際生在台灣求學與生活時，有效地應用華語進行溝通與表達。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is matched with the weekly teaching progress of critical thinking and expression in chinese (1) to carry out practical exercises and to improve the basic skills of international students in listening, speaking, reading and writing in Chinese, and train international students to effectively use Chinese for communication and expression when studying and living in Taiwan.",
